The translated MatchedRule proximity packing remains canonical. Equality-only
retained signatures normalize through that same packing and preserve duplicate
selector winner specificity/proximity; actual cascade ordering is unchanged.
Incomplete channels remain conservative. A warm, diagnostic-free ordinary
candidate query may be omitted only when full resolution is already required.
Scope/container diagnostics retain their original path and multiplicity.

Cross-revision numeric signatures never establish reuse. The only exception is
empty signatures certified in BOTH versions against strictly flat ordinary
leaf-rule sheets, with stable environment/registry and document TreeScope
ownership. Canonical StyleSheetContents includes all rule partitions; globals,
imports, layers, nested rules and diagnostics exclude the certificate. Refreshing
match IDs cannot upgrade incomplete native results without full resolution.

Static collector fallback classifications move to the existing revision-owned
routing plan, keeping query multiplicity. The immutable unregistered custom
property Rc identity shortcut follows registered-value comparison; COW updates
and the different-root deep comparison remain unchanged.
